  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1061BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Gilles",
  "en": "and they certainly had some\ninteresting things to say.",
  "fr": "Ils avaient certaines choses\nintéressantes à dire.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1061BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Gilles",
  "en": "What color is royal blood?",
  "fr": "De quelle couleur est le sang\nroyal ?",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1061BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Liane",
  "en": "That's easy. Everyone's blood is\nthe same color...isn't it?",
  "fr": "C'est facile. Le sang de tout le\nmonde a la même couleur... Non ?",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1061BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Gilles",
  "en": "The dauphin intends to test you\nby hiding himself\namong the nobles.",
  "fr": "Le dauphin essaie de vous\ntester en se cachant\fparmi les nobles.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1061BM",
  "max": 34,
