  "fr": "Trouvez le vrai dauphin, et\nfaites-lui croire en vous.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1061BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Gilles",
  "en": "...In your strength, Jeanne.",
  "fr": "... En votre force, Jeanne.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1061BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Gilles",
  "en": "...And that is all I can say. \nI'll be inside.",
